      "manual_openevolve_pairing_cache"
    ],
    "notes": "This contract is for the slow-simulation follow-up path only. It must not be used to mark Fig. 11 strict reproduction as successful. Agent profile parameters must come from the active recipe/contract, not from manual reproduction folders."
